OL,3,GNEWSAMan detained for killing woman in
OL,4,Aher home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who killed a mother in her home
OL,7,Fhas been detained in a secure hospital
OL,8,Ffor an unlimited time to protect the
OL,9,Fpublic.
OL,11,FBrian Simpson, 65, of Nene Court,
OL,12,FSpalding, was sentenced at Lincoln
OL,13,FCrown Court earlier after a jury found
OL,14,Fhe carried out the act of killing
OL,15,FKristine Sparane.
OL,17,FSparane, 37, was found by police
OL,18,Fcovered in blood on a bed at her flat
OL,19,Fin Winsover Road, Spalding, on 26
OL,20,FNovember 2024. She had sustained a
OL,21,Fnumber of blunt force injuries to her
OL,22,Fhead and a severe skull fracture.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
