OL,3,GNEWSAMan detained for killing woman in
OL,4,Aher home
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimpson was initially charged with
OL,7,Fmurder but a trial of facts had to be
OL,8,Fheld in May 2025 after he was deemed
OL,9,Funfit to face a criminal trial due to
OL,10,Fhis mental health.
